ss=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  sum <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\ndocument<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"1~100까지 수 중 3의 배수 합 : &lt;b>\"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> sum <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;/b>&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"label\" style=\"position:relative;\">label<a href=\"#label\" aria-label=\"label permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>제어를 블록 바깥으로 옮김</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\noutloop<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  inloop<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>j<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">===</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">===</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span> outloop<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"i = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\", j = \"</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token string\">\"&lt;br>\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4%EB%AC%B8%EC%9D%B4%EB%9E%80\">제어문이란?</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4%EB%AC%B8-1\">조건문</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#if\">if</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#ifelse\">if~else</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-ifelse\">다중 if~else</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#switchcase\">switch~case</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%B0%98%EB%B3%B5%EB%AC%B8-1\">반복문</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#for\">for</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#while\">while</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#dowhile%EB%AC%B8\">do~while문</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%B3%B4%EC%A1%B0-%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4%EB%AC%B8-1\">보조 제어문</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#break\">break</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#continue\">continue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#label\">label</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"제어문 (control statements)","summary":"제어문이란? 프로그램의 실행 과정을 제어하기 위해 사용하는 구문 조건문 조건에 따라 다음 문장을 선택적으로 실행 - i